Schema was inspected before author projection. Projection was limited to
the eight exercises and sixteen tasks, omitted author source excerpts,
and never accessed or displayed source.data. No original source or modern
file was freshly read. No solve, math, validator, PDF/image/browser,
dependency, skill, app, DB, Git or other-agent operation occurred.
No publisher-schema gate was imposed.

An execution-output truncation hid part of the final four author tasks.
Only those fields were re-displayed to finish this same comparison;
the author was not regenerated and no math was rerun.
Incremental usage, the preserved original usage and file hashes are
recorded in the comparison receipts. Assistant token/cost telemetry is
unavailable and is not reported as zero.

This is static agreement, not publication approval. No fixes, final keys
or choices were produced. STOP.
